      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_02",
      "hash64": "56D19E9ADF00CD7A",
      "text": "I must say, the academy emporium stocks some\\nrather splendid wares.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_03",
      "hash64": "56D19F9ADF00CF2D",
      "text": "I admit my expectations were far lower\\nthan warranted.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_04",
      "hash64": "E3AE74C104646246",
      "text": "Wow. He really seems to have taken a shine to\\nthe school store...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_05",
      "hash64": "E3AE75C1046463F9",
      "text": "Doesn’t seem like he’ll notice us anytime soon,\\nso I guess there’s no point whispering.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_06",
      "hash64": "E3AE72C104645EE0",
      "text": "You know, of all my Team Star friends, it’s Atticus\\nI’m worried will have the most trouble fitting in...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_04",
      "hash64": "56D1989ADF00C348",
      "text": "Greetings, my good shopkeep.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_05",
      "hash64": "56D1999ADF00C4FB",
      "text": "I would very much like to acquire the limited-\\nedition ninja garments released today.\\c\\nI believe you have five sets in stock, yes?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_shop_01",
      "hash64": "CEB99516CE53ECD8",
      "text": "Ah... The ninja cosplay set, yes?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_shop_02",
      "hash64": "CEB99816CE53F1F1",
      "text": "I’m sorry, dear, but someone bought the last two\\nfrom us earlier. We’re completely sold out.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_06",
      "hash64": "56D19A9ADF00C6AE",
      "text": "What?! This cannot be!!![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_07",
      "hash64": "56D19B9ADF00C861",
      "text": "If I am unable to procure those garments, why...\\nI... That will ruin everything![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_08",
      "hash64": "56D1949ADF00BC7C",
      "text": "It appears I have no choice but to track down\\nthis rival patron of mine! And when I find them...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_09",
      "hash64": "56D1959ADF00BE2F",
      "text": "I shall fix them with my piercing gaze and beg on\\nbended knee for the ninja garments I so crave![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_07",
      "hash64": "E3AE73C104646093",
      "text": "Whaaaaaat?! Since WHEN was Atticus this\\ngood-looking?![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_08",
      "hash64": "E3AE80C1046476AA",
      "text": "Wait, no, focus! If he starts begging some kid for\\ntheir ninja outfit, people will think he’s a weirdo.\\r\\nWe should stop him, right?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_select_03",
      "hash64": "9C6186E66962170A",
      "text": "Yeah, time for an intervention",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_select_04",
      "hash64": "9C6181E669620E8B",
      "text": "Let’s just see how this pans out",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_09a",
      "hash64": "45FEB6FA76B84DF4",
      "text": "Th-then that’s what we’ll do![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_09b",
      "hash64": "45FEB9FA76B8530D",
      "text": "Seriously? But...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_01",
      "hash64": "CFF667CFE19942AD",
      "text": "Oh, Don Atticus! Here you are!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_10",
      "hash64": "56D5229ADF03E39D",
      "text": "My young compadre![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_11",
      "hash64": "56D5219ADF03E1EA",
      "text": "I...I must apologize.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_12",
      "hash64": "56D5209ADF03E037",
      "text": "About the garments I promised you so that we\\nmight dress as ninja together...[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_02",
      "hash64": "CFF664CFE1993D94",
      "text": "Oh yeah, I got us covered! I already bought two\\nsets of that ninja cosplay stuff for us to wear!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_13",
      "hash64": "56D51F9ADF03DE84",
      "text": "...I beg your pardon?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_03",
      "hash64": "CFF665CFE1993F47",
      "text": "When I came here earlier, the shopkeeper lady\\nwas putting them out on the shelves.\\c\\nSo I bought one for you and one for me!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_04",
      "hash64": "CFF662CFE1993A2E",
      "text": "You know how popular these outfits are...\\nI was super lucky to be able to snag ’em!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_05",
      "hash64": "CFF663CFE1993BE1",
      "text": "Now c’mon! Let’s go play ninja outside!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_14",
      "hash64": "56D51E9ADF03DCD1",
      "text": "Goodness me... What a happy turn of events![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_15",
      "hash64": "56D51D9ADF03DB1E",
      "text": "I shall retrieve my shuriken from my quarters\\nso that we might enjoy some target practice![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_06",
      "hash64": "CFF660CFE19936C8",
      "text": "Ooooooh! Awesome!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_16",
      "hash64": "56D51C9ADF03D96B",
      "text": "I can also use my masterful stitchery to transform\\nthy ninja garments into a sublime vision of poison!\\r\\nWhat say you?[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_student_07",
      "hash64": "CFF661CFE199387B",
      "text": "Ummm... I’m good, thanks.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_doku_17",
      "hash64": "56D51B9ADF03D7B8",
      "text": "Ha ha ha! The insolence of this one![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "kizuna_botan_b_10",
      "hash64": "E3B1FEC10467829B",
      "text": "Phew... Looks like he was able to wrap up this\\nlittle escapade without making a scene.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
